#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:15
msgid ""
"The loader accepts a single `model.safetensors` file or an indexed "
"sharded checkpoint with `model.safetensors.index.json` and its referenced"
" shards. PyTorch `.bin` checkpoints are not an accepted input format. The"
" documented validation workflow primarily covers indexed sharded "
"checkpoints; single-file input is implemented but should still be checked"
" in the target code and runtime environment."
msgstr "The loader accepts a single `model.safetensors` file or an 带索引的 分片的 检查点 with `model.safetensors.index.json` and its referenced 分片。 PyTorch `.bin` 检查点 are not an 接受的 输入 format。 The documented 验证 工作流 primarily covers 带索引的 分片的 检查点； single-file 输入 is implemented but should still be checked in the 目标 代码 and 运行时 环境。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:17
msgid "A source directory normally contains:"
msgstr "A 源 目录 normally 包含："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:27
msgid ""
"For a single-file checkpoint, use `model.safetensors` instead of the "
"index and shard set. Keep input and output directories separate. For a "
"formal run, use a new empty output directory so stale shards, indexes, "
"manifests, or configuration files cannot be mixed with the new result."
msgstr "For a single-file 检查点， use `model.safetensors` instead of the index and shard set。 Keep 输入 and 输出 目录 单独。 For a 正式 运行， use a new 空 输出 目录 so stale 分片， indexes， manifests， or 配置 files cannot be mixed with the new 结果。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:29
msgid "MXFP4 recognition"
msgstr "MXFP4 识别"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:31
msgid ""
"An MXFP4 weight must be a two-dimensional byte-sized tensor with a "
"matching scale row count. The layout must satisfy:"
msgstr "An MXFP4 权重 必须 be a two-dimensional byte-sized tensor with a 匹配的 缩放 行 数量。 The layout 必须 满足："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:37
msgid ""
"The logical input dimension is twice the packed byte-column count. A byte"
" tensor with a scale tensor that does not satisfy these relationships is "
"not accepted as MXFP4 merely because its dtype looks plausible."
msgstr "The 逻辑 输入 dimension is twice the 打包 byte-列 数量。 A byte tensor with a 缩放 tensor that does not 满足 these relationships is not 接受的 as MXFP4 merely because its 数据类型 looks plausible。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:39
msgid "Block FP8 recognition"
msgstr "Block FP8 识别"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:41
msgid ""
"For a two-dimensional weight with `rows` and `cols`, the E8M0 scale "
"tensor must contain exactly:"
msgstr "For a two-dimensional 权重 with `rows` and `cols`， the E8M0 缩放 tensor 必须 contain exactly："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:47
msgid ""
"This count includes padding tiles. Dtype alone is not sufficient to "
"classify a tensor as block FP8."
msgstr "This 数量 includes 填充 tiles。 数据类型 alone is not sufficient to classify a tensor as 块 FP8。"

