#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:59
msgid ""
"Quantization reduces weight-related storage only. KV cache, runtime "
"workspace, communication buffers, graph capture, and framework overhead "
"do not shrink proportionally with weight bit width."
msgstr "量化 reduces 权重-related 存储 仅。 KV cache， 运行时 工作区， communication 缓冲区， graph capture， and 框架 开销 do not shrink proportionally with 权重 位 宽度。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:61
msgid "compressed-tensors storage"
msgstr "compressed-tensors 存储"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:63
msgid ""
"MSE W4A16 and W8A16 use the `compressed-tensors` `pack-quantized` scheme."
" Packed weights use `torch.int32` storage. The logical weight shape is "
"recorded separately as an `int64[2]` `<weight>_shape` tensor."
msgstr "MSE W4A16 and W8A16 use the `compressed-tensors` `pack-quantized` scheme。 打包 权重 use `torch.int32` 存储。 The 逻辑 权重 形状 is 记录 separately as an `int64[2]` `<weight>_shape` tensor。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:65
msgid ""
"For INT4, signed values are encoded as unsigned nibble codes by adding "
"`8`. Each `int32` word stores consecutive input values from low to high "
"order. The packed input dimension is:"
msgstr "For INT4， 有符号 值 are 编码 as 无符号 nibble codes by adding `8`。 Each `int32` 字 存储 连续 输入 值 from low to high 顺序。 The 打包 输入 dimension is："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:71
msgid ""
"The INT4 packed-input constraint also requires `in_features` to be "
"divisible by `8`."
msgstr "The INT4 打包-输入 约束 also 需要 `in_features` to be divisible by `8`。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:73
msgid ""
"W8A16 uses `int32` uint8b128 packing. Each word contains four byte codes."
" The physical packed storage may contain more columns than the logical "
"input dimension when padding is required. Padding uses zero code `128`. "
"The `<weight>_shape` tensor preserves the logical two-dimensional shape "
"so the runtime can distinguish physical storage from logical dimensions. "
"MSE W8A16 scales are stored as BF16."
msgstr "W8A16 使用 `int32` uint8b128 packing。 Each 字 包含 four byte codes。 The 物理 打包 存储 may contain more columns than the 逻辑 输入 dimension when 填充 is 必需。 填充 使用 zero 代码 `128`。 The `<weight>_shape` tensor preserves the 逻辑 two-dimensional 形状 so the 运行时 can distinguish 物理 存储 from 逻辑 维度。 MSE W8A16 scales are stored as BF16。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:75
msgid "For group quantization, the scale shape is:"
msgstr "For 分组 量化， the 缩放 形状 is："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:81
msgid "For channel quantization, the scale shape is:"
msgstr "For channel 量化， the 缩放 形状 is："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:87
msgid ""
"MSE W8A8 uses the `compressed-tensors` `int-quantized` scheme. The weight"
" tensor keeps its logical name and uses raw signed `torch.int8` storage. "
"Its scale is per output channel with shape `[out_features, 1]` and uses "
"the selected FP32 or BF16 scale dtype. The activation configuration is "
"dynamic, symmetric, per-token INT8."
msgstr "MSE W8A8 使用 the `compressed-tensors` `int-quantized` scheme。 The 权重 tensor keeps its 逻辑 name and 使用 raw 有符号 `torch.int8` 存储。 Its 缩放 is per 输出 channel with 形状 `[out_features， 1]` and 使用 the 选中的 FP32 or BF16 缩放 数据类型。 The 激活 配置 is 动态， 对称， per-token INT8。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:89
msgid ""
"The compressed-tensors configuration in `config.json` identifies the "
"scheme. A generated compressed-tensors artifact also contains the "
"quantization manifest and execution report described in [output files"
"](output-files.md). Per-selector mixed W4A16/W8A8 output uses the `mixed-"
"precision` top-level format with `pack-quantized` and `int-quantized` "
"groups."
msgstr "The compressed-tensors 配置 in `config.json` identifies the scheme。 A generated compressed-tensors 产物 also 包含 the 量化 manifest and execution report 描述 in [output files](output-files.md)。 Per-选择器 mixed W4A16/W8A8 输出 使用 the `mixed-precision` top-level format with `pack-quantized` and `int-quantized` 组。"

