"The input and output dimensions must satisfy the corresponding pack-"
"factor divisibility constraints. AutoGPTQ zero codes use:"
msgstr "The 输入 and 输出 维度 必须 满足 the corresponding pack-因子 divisibility constraints。 AutoGPTQ zero codes use："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:114
