"Native GPTQ and AutoRound remove the original `.weight` tensor and export"
" the native tensors. AutoRound uses this GPTQ ABI and retains `algorithm:"
" autoround` provenance in metadata. It does not define a separate "
"AutoRound storage ABI."
msgstr "原生 GPTQ and AutoRound 移除 the 原始 `.weight` tensor and 导出 the 原生 tensors。 AutoRound 使用 this GPTQ ABI and retains `algorithm： autoround` 来源 in 元数据。 It does not define a 单独 AutoRound 存储 ABI。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:116
msgid "Native AWQ GEMM storage"
msgstr "原生 AWQ GEMM 存储"

