msgstr "`[groups, out_features]`, normally float16"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:126
msgid ""
"The selected layer's `in_features` must be divisible by the group size, "
"and `out_features` must be divisible by `8`. AWQ GEMM nibble order is:"
msgstr "The 选中的 layer's `in_features` 必须 be divisible by the 分组 大小， and `out_features` 必须 be divisible by `8`。 AWQ GEMM nibble 顺序 is："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:132
msgid ""
"This is not simple consecutive nibble order. Native AWQ exports use "
"`quant_config.json`. Native GPTQ and AutoRound exports use "
"`quantize_config.json`."
msgstr "This is not simple 连续 nibble 顺序。 原生 AWQ exports use `quant_config.json`。 原生 GPTQ and AutoRound exports use `quantize_config.json`。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:134
msgid "Fused expert naming"
msgstr "融合专家命名"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:136
msgid ""
"Fused expert banks may be expanded into loader-facing per-expert names "
"such as:"
msgstr "Fused expert banks may be expanded into loader-facing per-expert 名称 such as："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:143
msgid ""
"Do not infer a fused layout from names alone. Use layout recognition, "
"shape inference, and dry-run output. A fused `gate_up_proj` must be split"
" along the model-defined output dimension, and the complete gate, up, and"
" down bank must remain selected as one inference unit."
msgstr "Do not infer a fused layout from 名称 alone。 Use layout recognition， 形状 推理， and dry-运行 输出。 A fused `gate_up_proj` 必须 be 划分 along the model-defined 输出 dimension， and the 完整 gate， up， and down bank 必须 remain 选中的 as one 推理 unit。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:145
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:147
msgid "INT4 packing"
msgstr "INT4 打包"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:149
msgid "`in_features` must be divisible by `8` for packed INT4 storage."
msgstr "`in_features` 必须 be divisible by `8` for 打包 INT4 存储。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:150
msgid ""
"Group quantization also requires every selected layer's `in_features` to "
"be divisible by `group_size`."
msgstr "分组 量化 also 需要 every 选中的 layer's `in_features` to be divisible by `group_size`。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:152
msgid "Strategy constraints"
msgstr "策略约束"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:154
msgid "Channel strategy must omit `group_size`."
msgstr "Channel 策略 必须 omit `group_size`。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:155
msgid "Channel strategy is currently valid for INT8 policies only."
msgstr "Channel 策略 is 当前 valid for INT8 policies 仅。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:156
msgid ""
"W8A16 channel quantization is supported for ordinary Linear, attention, "
"and shared-expert weights, but cannot be used for routed experts."
msgstr "W8A16 通道 量化 is supported for 普通 Linear， 注意力， and shared-expert 权重， but cannot be used for routed experts。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:157
msgid "Routed experts can use group strategy for W4A16 or W8A16."
msgstr "Routed experts can use 分组 策略 for W4A16 or W8A16。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:158
msgid ""
"W8A8 channel routed-MoE quantization is allowed when the full W8A8 "
"parameter combination is used."
msgstr "W8A8 channel routed-MoE 量化 is allowed when the full W8A8 parameter combination is used。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:160
msgid "W8A8 fixed parameters"
msgstr "W8A8 固定参数"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:162
msgid "W8A8 requires exactly:"
msgstr "W8A8 需要 exactly："

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:168
msgid ""
"Do not pass `--group-size`. W8A8 weights are raw signed INT8 and "
"activations are dynamic, symmetric, per-token INT8."
msgstr "Do not pass `--group-size`。 W8A8 权重 are raw 有符号 INT8 and activations are 动态， 对称， per-token INT8。"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.md:171
msgid ""
"A structurally valid storage format does not guarantee a runtime kernel. "
"Check the target loader and hardware independently."
msgstr "A structurally valid 存储 format does not guarantee a 运行时 kernel。 Check the 目标 loader and 硬件 独立。"

